# PUSH_CODE_TELEMETRY_RESPONSE (0x8B): reserved, pubkey_prefix[6], Cayenne LPP (big-endian):
# ch1 voltage 4.01 V, ch2 humidity 55.5 %, ch2 pressure 1013.2 hPa, ch1 temperature 21.5 C.
# That order is the firmware's, not a choice: the battery is written before querySensors() and
# the MCU temperature after it, so a channel-1 temperature always follows the channel-2 sensors
# (until tasks/phase-3.5/42 this fixture had the two channel-1 readings adjacent, which the
# firmware cannot emit).
